LOCUS       6ZVRYN_1_G160Y        8012 bp DNA     circular SYN 20-NOV-2025
DEFINITION  Protein expression plasmid for the Spike from 229E-CoV strain 5/9/84
            codon optimized, with the last 19 amino acids removed, and with 
            addition of the point mutation G160Y. The plasmid sequenced at 
            Primodium by Sheri Harari on 11/18/25.
